BT /F1 10 Tf 72 720 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (for fruit in ["apple", "mango", "banana"]:) Tj 0 -13 Td (    print\("I like", fruit\)) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (To repeat something a set number of times, use range. range\(5\) produces the numbers 0, 1, 2, 3) Tj 0 -13 Td (and 4; it stops before 5. range\(1, 6\) starts at 1 instead.) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (total = 0) Tj 0 -13 Td (for number in range\(1, 6\):) Tj 0 -13 Td (    total = total + number) Tj 0 -13 Td (print\("The sum is", total\)) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (A while loop repeats as long as its condition stays true. It is useful when you do not know in) Tj 0 -13 Td (advance how many times to repeat, such as asking a question until the answer is valid:) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (answer = "") Tj 0 -13 Td (while answer != "yes":) Tj 0 -13 Td (    answer = input\("Are you ready? "\)) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (Make sure something inside a while loop eventually makes the condition false, or the loop will) Tj 0 -13 Td (never end. Inside any loop, break stops the loop immediately and continue skips to the next) Tj 0 -13 Td (repetition.) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (Putting It Together) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (Here is a small program that uses everything in this guide. It asks for five test scores, adds) Tj 0 -13 Td (them up, and reports the average with a grade:) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (total = 0) Tj 0 -13 Td (for test in range\(1, 6\):) Tj 0 -13 Td (    score = float\(input\(f"Score for test {test}: "\)\)) Tj 0 -13 Td (    total = total + score) Tj 0 -13 Td (average = total / 5) Tj 0 -13 Td (if average >= 80:) Tj 0 -13 Td (    grade = "A") Tj 0 -13 Td (elif average >= 60:) Tj 0 -13 Td (    grade = "B") Tj 0 -13 Td (else:) Tj 0 -13 Td (    grade = "C") Tj 0 -13 Td (print\(f"Average: {round\(average, 1\)}, grade {grade}"\)) Tj 0 -13 Td () Tj 0 -13 Td (Try changing the number of tests, or add a check that refuses scores below 0 or above 100 by) Tj 0 -13 Td (using a while loop. Small changes like these are the fastest way to become comfortable with) Tj 0 -13 Td (Python.) Tj 0 -13 Td ET
